#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:16 98d2d32f7e9c42d798589cc5e9f6f805
msgid "Performs real-time frequency spectrum analysis on audio signals for visualization and analysis."
msgstr "频谱分析器，可读取频段幅度、RMS 和频谱重心。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:21 c84ef5b913b0431eb43ee6f833efd3fc
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:23 6ec43ca52cde4e68a8b7f86ed3a604f7
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer analyzes the frequency content of audio passing through an audio "
"bus in real-time using Fast Fourier Transform (FFT). This is essential for creating audio "
"visualizations such as spectrum analyzers, equalizer displays, or reactive audio effects."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer**    会在总线效果链中插入 FFT "
"DSP，并从中读取频谱数据。它不会主动改变声音，主要用于可视化、节拍/能量检测、频段驱动的 UI 或调试混音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:25 50df952a08be4773ab40ccac2bd06e21
msgid ""
"The effect processes incoming audio and provides frequency magnitude data that can be queried "
"using "
":ref:`get_magnitude_for_frequency_range()<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_method_get_magnitude_for_frequency_range>`."
" You can analyze specific frequency ranges (e.g., bass, midrange, treble) independently."
msgstr ""
"处理输入音频并提供频率幅度数据，可通过    "
":ref:`get_magnitude_for_frequency_range()<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_method_get_magnitude_for_frequency_range>`"
"    分别查询低频、中频、高频等频段。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:27 ff0843e6cb864b3b910d83fb809e288b
msgid ""
"Queries reuse a spectrum snapshot while the bus DSP clock is unchanged. The next audio block "
"automatically refreshes the snapshot, including when manually mixing multiple blocks in one game "
"frame. Changing :ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>` or "
"attaching the effect to another bus invalidates the snapshot."
msgstr ""
"总线 DSP 时钟未变化时，查询会复用频谱快照。下一个音频块会刷新快照，同一游戏帧中手动混音多个音频块时也会更新。修改    "
":ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>`    或将效果器挂载到其他总线会使快照失效。"

