#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:381 dbb205aa0d59466e95373bd2c4653fd0
msgid ""
"Returns the magnitude (amplitude) of the specified frequency range as a "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>`. The ``x`` component contains the left channel magnitude and ``y`` "
"contains the right channel magnitude."
msgstr "返回指定频率范围内左右声道的幅度。 （参见   :ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>`  ）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:383 65fe12a42d2e43dfaad586c9528f956e
msgid ""
"The ``begin`` and ``end`` parameters specify the frequency range in Hz (e.g., 20.0 to 200.0 for "
"bass frequencies). The ``mode`` determines how the magnitude is calculated across the range: "
":ref:`MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_constant_MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE>` "
"calculates the average magnitude, while "
":ref:`MAGNITUDE_MAX<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_constant_MAGNITUDE_MAX>` returns the "
"peak magnitude."
msgstr ""
"``begin``  和  ``end``  指定频率范围，单位为 Hz，例如低频可使用 20.0 到 200.0。 ``mode``  决定统计方式： "
":ref:`MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_constant_MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE>`  "
"计算平均幅度， :ref:`MAGNITUDE_MAX<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_constant_MAGNITUDE_MAX>`  "
"返回峰值幅度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:385 a147590ab9284147be8b8681d063544d
msgid ""
"Magnitude values are in linear scale (0.0 to 1.0+). Use ``linear_to_db()`` to convert to decibels"
" for display purposes."
msgstr "幅度采用线性刻度（0.0 到 1.0 及以上）。显示时可用    ``linear_to_db()``    转换为分贝。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:27
#: ebf51b701eb7466ca5f2ce54001c225b
msgid ""
"The :ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>` determines the "
"analysis window and frequency resolution. Larger FFT sizes provide finer frequency detail at "
"the cost of time resolution and processing work. "
":ref:`buffer_length<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_buffer_length>` is "
"currently stored for compatibility and does not change the FFT window or retain audio "
"history."
msgstr ""
":ref:`fft_size<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_fft_size>`  决定分析窗口和频率分辨率。FFT "
"越大，频率细节越精确，但时间分辨率更低、处理开销更大。 "
":ref:`buffer_length<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_property_buffer_length>`  "
"当前仅为兼容而保存，不会改变 FFT 窗口，也不会保留音频历史。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:138
#: 4e2adc212efd4983b64979abcfb3d153
msgid ""
"Sentinel marking the end of the FFT size enumeration. It is not a valid size and is rejected "
"by :ref:`set_fft_size()<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_method_set_fft_size>`."
msgstr ""
"标记 FFT 大小枚举末尾的边界值，不是有效大小， "
":ref:`set_fft_size()<class_FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer_method_set_fft_size>`  会拒绝该值。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectspectrumanalyzer.rst:203
#: 04d7b56c30a64b86a3e54e3d8433d853
msgid ""
"Stored compatibility value in seconds, clamped to 0.1 through 10.0. The default is 2.0. The "
"current implementation does not use this property to allocate history, smooth results, or "
"change analysis latency."
msgstr "保存的兼容值，单位为秒，限制在 0.1 到 10.0，默认为 2.0。当前实现不使用该属性分配历史缓冲、平滑结果或改变分析延迟。"
